# Build context = the repo root. Everything not needed to SERVE the app stays
# out of the image, and the two things that must never leave this box are
# listed first.

# ── Secrets ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Bryan's real Google Street View key lives here (gitignored in the repo).
# The Dockerfile writes js/config.example.js over js/config.js instead.
js/config.js
.dev-certs/
*.pem
*.key
.env
.env.*

# ── Repo plumbing ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git
.gitignore
.github/

# ── Dev-only pages and tooling ────────────────────────────────────────────
# phone.html and mobile-harness.html frame the app in an iframe for viewport
# testing; serve-mobile.sh is the local HTTPS dev server. None belong on a
# public draft.
phone.html
mobile-harness.html
serve-mobile.sh
docs/
README.md

# ── The deploy set itself ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# nginx.conf.template is COPYed explicitly by path, so the rest of deploy/
# does not need to be in the image.
deploy/deploy.sh
deploy/service.yaml
deploy/README.md

# ── Junk ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/.DS_Store
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/node_modules/
*.log
*.swp
